      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "lines": [
        13,
        13
      ],
      "raw": "Orders placed outside of market hours, like equities Orders placed overnight, will be filled at market open, like they would be in production. However, if you would like to test an immediate execution, even outside of market hours, set a special flag on the Account you’re testing in:",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "Orders placed outside of market hours, like equities Orders placed overnight, will be filled at market open, like they would be in production. However, if you would like to test an immediate execution, even outside of market hours, set a special flag on the Account you’re testing in:",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
